sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant S as Server
    B->>S: POST /login (alice, password)
    S->>S: check password, build claims
    S->>S: tag = HMAC(key, header.payload)
    S-->>B: header.payload.tag
    Note over B: Anyone can read header and payload.<br/>Nobody without the key can produce a matching tag.
    B->>S: GET /docs/17 with header.payload.tag
    S->>S: recompute HMAC(key, header.payload)
    S->>S: constant-time compare with tag
    S-->>B: 200 if equal, 401 if not
